OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy with further rain at
OL,7,Ftimes during the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight, with just a few drier
OL,9,Fclearer spells in the northwest. Winds
OL,10,Feasing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with some outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain, lasting most of the day in
OL,14,Fthe east, while the west will turn a
OL,15,Flittle brighter later with a few
OL,16,Fshowers.
